# Fast, and only on what is being committed: format + lint of the staged files
# (.lintstagedrc) and the typecheck (~3 s). The whole check used to run here on every
# commit (~75 s, and `prettier --check .` looked at files that were not being
# committed). The full suite runs in CI on a clean Linux, which is the judge.
bunx lint-staged
bun run typecheck
